    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="section-label">How B2B appointment setting works</div>
      <h2>From market definition to qualified handoff.</h2>
      <div class="appointment-process-rail">
        <article><span>01</span><h3>Campaign foundation</h3><p>Clarify the offer, ICP, buyer roles, proof, exclusions, objections, qualification rules, meeting purpose, and handoff fields.</p></article>
