        <article><span>05</span><h3>Qualification</h3><p>Confirm the agreed meeting criteria in a real conversation and capture what sales needs to know.</p></article>
        <article><span>06</span><h3>Book and hand off</h3><p>Set the meeting, confirm expectations, pass the context, and keep the outcome visible in the agreed workflow.</p></article>
